<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Adecco S.A.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Adecco S.A.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. New York, Frankfurt branch has issued 2.5 million American-style call warrants on Addecco S.A. bearer shares, lead manager Citibank, Zurich said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    375 CHF		   PREMIUM	21.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.50 CHF		  GEARING	=</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	08.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	24.SEP.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  354 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
